{"sha": "a4d1018fbcd7dacab9583892cd3c12b59df93aa8eaadab973c3021f0678f9e71", "body": ["\\textbf{3.} $v = 60/7.07 = \\qty{8.5}{m/s}$; $\\tfrac12\\rho v^2 = \\qty{0.36}{bar}$; $P =", "P_0 + \\rho gH - \\tfrac12\\rho v^2 = \\qty{20.3}{bar}$ 绝对压强。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $v_j = \\sqrt{2gH} = \\qty{62.6}{m/s}$; $s = 60/62.6 = \\qty{0.96}{m^2}$, $d =", "\\qty{1.1}{m}$.", "", "\\textbf{5.} $\\tfrac12\\rho D_Vv_j^2 = \\tfrac12\\rho D_V(2gH) = \\rho gD_VH = \\qty{118}{MW}$.", "", "\\textbf{6.} $m = \\rho S\\ell = \\qty{2.8e6}{kg}$, $E_k = \\tfrac12mv^2 = \\qty{1.0e8}{J}$;", "渡越时间 $\\ell/v = \\qty{47}{s}$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $\\rho gH = (P - P_0) + \\tfrac12\\rho v^2$：\\qty{19.3}{bar} 的压强，", "以及 \\qty{0.36}{bar} 的动能；在喷管中压强降到", "$P_0$，而 $\\tfrac12\\rho v^2$ 升到 $\\rho gH$；紧接其后，$P = P_0$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $\\Delta h = \\lambda(\\ell/D)v^2/2g = 0.015 \\times 133 \\times 3.67 = \\qty{7.3}{m}$,", "$3.7\\%$ 的功率。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $v = \\qty{19.1}{m/s}$, $v^2/2g = \\qty{18.6}{m}$, $\\Delta h = 0.015 \\times 200 \\times", "18.6 = \\qty{56}{m}$：$28\\%$ 损失 --- 节省钢材的代价，", "每秒都要以能量来支付。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $v_t = 60/\\pi = \\qty{19.1}{m/s}$; $\\Delta P = 500(19.1^2 - 8.49^2) =", "\\qty{146}{kPa}$.", "", "\\textbf{11.} $\\Delta P = (\\rho_{\\text{Hg}} - \\rho)g\\,\\Delta h$: $\\Delta h = 146000/(12600", "\\times 9.81) = \\qty{1.18}{m}$.", "", "\\textbf{12.} $\\Delta P \\propto v^2 \\propto D_V^2$：$D_V \\propto \\sqrt{\\Delta h}$；流量减半", "则降为四分之一，即 \\qty{0.30}{m}。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 突出的测压孔迎着或扰动流动，读到的只是部分", "动压（即皮托管），而非静压。", "", "\\textbf{14.} $P = P_0 - \\rho g \\times 6 - \\tfrac12\\rho v^2 = 100 - 59 - 36 = \\qty{5}{kPa}$:", "接近蒸气压时，溶解的空气逸出，水可能", "沸腾（即空化），使水柱断开。降低峰顶，或装设", "空气阀与真空泵，或减小流量。", "", "\\textbf{15.} $D_V/A = 60/2 \\times 10^6 = \\qty{3e-5}{m/s} = \\qty{11}{cm/h}$.", "", "\\textbf{16.} $A\\,\\dd h/\\dd t = -s\\sqrt{2gh}$: $\\sqrt h = \\sqrt{h_0} - (s/A)\\sqrt{g/2}\\,t$.", "", "\\textbf{17.} $\\Delta t = (A/s)\\sqrt{2/g}(\\sqrt{200} - \\sqrt{190}) = 2.09 \\times 10^6 \\times", "0.45 \\times 0.36 = \\qty{3.4e5}{s} = \\qty{3.9}{days}$；若设计流量恒定，", "$10A/D_V = \\qty{3.3e5}{s}$：二者几乎相同，喷管已按", "托里拆利在 $h \\approx H$ 时的流量定尺寸。", "", "\\textbf{18.} $\\ell\\,\\dd v/\\dd t = gH - v^2/2$: $v = V\\tanh(Vt/2\\ell)$, $V = \\qty{62.6}{m/s}$,", "时间常数 $2\\ell/V = \\qty{13}{s}$。", "", "\\textbf{19.} 在 $v = V/2$ 处：$\\dd v/\\dd t = (gH - V^2/8)/\\ell = \\qty{3.7}{m/s^2}$；", "$P = P_0 + \\rho gH - \\tfrac12\\rho v^2 - \\rho\\ell\\,\\dd v/\\dd t = 1.0 + 19.6 - 4.9 - 14.7", "= \\qty{1.0}{bar}$：水头的大部分用来加速水柱，故", "管底压强远低于其稳态值。", "", "\\textbf{20.} $|\\dd v/\\dd t| = 8.49/10 = \\qty{0.85}{m/s^2}$: $\\Delta P = \\rho\\ell \\times 0.85 =", "\\qty{3.4}{bar}$.", "", "\\textbf{21.} $\\Delta P = 1000 \\times 1400 \\times 8.49 = \\qty{119}{bar}$，是", "静压的六倍。波的往返时间为 $2\\ell/c = \\qty{0.57}{s}$：凡快于此的", "关闭称为“突然”关闭，获得完整的儒可夫斯基", "超压；较慢的关闭所得超压较小。", "", "\\textbf{22.} $Av = A_s\\,\\dd z/\\dd t$.", "", "\\textbf{23.} 沿隧洞应用欧拉方程，从水库（压强", "$P_0 + \\rho g\\times$水深）至竖井底部（压强 $P_0 + \\rho g", "(\\text{水深} + z)$）：$\\rho L\\,\\dd v/\\dd t = -\\rho gz$；其中 $v = (A_s/A)\\dot z$：", "$\\ddot z + (gA/LA_s)z = 0$; $T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{LA_s/gA} = 2\\pi\\sqrt{2000 \\times 100/", "68.7} = \\qty{340}{s} \\approx \\qty{5.7}{min}$.", "", "\\textbf{24.} $\\tfrac12\\rho ALv^2 = \\tfrac12\\rho gA_sz_{\\max}^2$，其中取 $v = 60/7 =", "\\qty{8.6}{m/s}$: $z_{\\max} = v\\sqrt{AL/gA_s} = \\qty{32}{m}$.", "", "\\textbf{25.} 坝：流体静力学，$\\rho gh$。涡轮机、阀门关闭时：", "同样为 $\\rho gH$。压力管道运行时：伯努利方程，$\\tfrac12\\rho v^2$ 取自", "静水头。水锤：可压缩性，$\\rho c\\Delta v$。", "涌浪：沿隧洞的非定常欧拉方程，其振荡周期为", "$2\\pi\\sqrt{LA_s/gA}$.", "\\end{solution}", ""]}